{"seq":2,"slug":"data-types-and-affinity","title":"数据类型与亲和性","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/sqlite-embedded-db/foundations/data-types-and-affinity","wordCount":860,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"数据类型与亲和性\">数据类型与亲和性</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>SQLite 的类型系统与多数关系数据库相反：类型绑定在<strong>值</strong>（Value）而非列上，因此同一列可以存放任意存储类的数据。列上声明的类型只是<strong>类型亲和性</strong>（Type Affinity）——一种插入时尝试转换的&quot;推荐类型&quot;，而非强制约束。掌握&quot;存储类决定值本身、亲和性决定转换行为&quot;这一分工，是理解 SQLite 动态类型、比较规则与 STRICT 表的关键。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"动态类型系统\">动态类型系统</h2><p>SQLite 采用<strong>动态类型</strong>（Dynamic Typing）系统，这是它与其他关系数据库最显著的区别之一。在 PostgreSQL 或 MySQL 中，类型绑定在列上；而在 SQLite 中，类型绑定在<strong>值</strong>（Value）上。任何列可以存储任何类型的数据。</p>\n<p>SQLite 定义了五种基本<strong>存储类</strong>（Storage Class）：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>存储类</th>\n<th>描述</th>\n<th>占用空间</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>NULL</td>\n<td>空值</td>\n<td>0 字节</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>INTEGER</td>\n<td>有符号整数，1/2/3/4/6/8 字节</td>\n<td>可变（1-8 字节）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>REAL</td>\n<td>8 字节 IEEE 754 浮点数</td>\n<td>8 字节</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>TEXT</td>\n<td>UTF-8/UTF-16 编码的文本字符串</td>\n<td>可变</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>BLOB</td>\n<td>二进制大对象，按输入原样存储</td>\n<td>可变</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- SQLite 允许任何列存储任何类型&#10;CREATE TABLE demo (value);&#10;&#10;INSERT INTO demo VALUES (42);&#10;INSERT INTO demo VALUES (3.14);&#10;INSERT INTO demo VALUES (&#39;hello&#39;);&#10;INSERT INTO demo VALUES (NULL);&#10;INSERT INTO demo VALUES (X&#39;DEADBEEF&#39;);&#10;&#10;-- 查看每个值的实际类型&#10;SELECT value, typeof(value) FROM demo;&#10;-- 42       | integer&#10;-- 3.14     | real&#10;-- hello    | text&#10;-- NULL     | null&#10;-- DEADBEEF | blob\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- SQLite 允许任何列存储任何类型</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> demo</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">value</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INSERT INTO</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> demo </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VALUES</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">42</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INSERT INTO</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> demo </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VALUES</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">14</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INSERT INTO</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> demo </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VALUES</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'hello'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INSERT INTO</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> demo </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VALUES</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INSERT INTO</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> demo </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VALUES</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (X</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'DEADBEEF'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 查看每个值的实际类型</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> value</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, typeof(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">value</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> demo;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 42       | integer</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 3.14     | real</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- hello    | text</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- NULL     | null</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- DEADBEEF | blob</span></span></code></pre></div><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> <code>typeof()</code> 函数返回的是值的实际存储类，而不是列声明的类型。这是理解 SQLite 类型系统的关键。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"类型亲和性\">类型亲和性</h2><p>虽然 SQLite 是动态类型的，但它通过<strong>类型亲和性</strong>（Type Affinity）机制为列提供了&quot;推荐类型&quot;。当插入数据时，SQLite 会尝试将值转换为该列的亲和类型。</p>\n<p>SQLite 定义了五种类型亲和性：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    subgraph 类型亲和性&#10;        TEXT_A[TEXT]&#10;        NUM[NUMERIC]&#10;        INT[INTEGER]&#10;        REAL_A[REAL]&#10;        BLOB_A[BLOB]&#10;    end&#10;    声明类型 --&gt; 亲和性规则 --&gt; 类型亲和性\">graph LR\n    subgraph 类型亲和性\n        TEXT_A[TEXT]\n        NUM[NUMERIC]\n        INT[INTEGER]\n        REAL_A[REAL]\n        BLOB_A[BLOB]\n    end\n    声明类型 --&gt; 亲和性规则 --&gt; 类型亲和性</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>亲和性</th>\n<th>规则</th>\n<th>转换行为</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>TEXT</td>\n<td>声明包含 &quot;CHAR&quot;、&quot;CLOB&quot;、&quot;TEXT&quot;</td>\n<td>将数值转为文本</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>NUMERIC</td>\n<td>不匹配其他规则的声明</td>\n<td>尝试转为 INTEGER 或 REAL</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>INTEGER</td>\n<td>声明包含 &quot;INT&quot;</td>\n<td>尝试转为整数</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>REAL</td>\n<td>声明包含 &quot;REAL&quot;、&quot;FLOA&quot;、&quot;DOUB&quot;</td>\n<td>尝试转为浮点数</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>BLOB</td>\n<td>声明包含 &quot;BLOB&quot; 或无声明</td>\n<td>不做任何转换</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>亲和性的判定遵循优先级规则：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- INTEGER 亲和性：声明中包含 &quot;INT&quot;&#10;CREATE TABLE t1 (x INTEGER);&#10;INSERT INTO t1 VALUES (&#39;123&#39;);&#10;SELECT x, typeof(x) FROM t1;&#10;-- 123 | integer（文本 &#39;123&#39; 被转换为整数）&#10;&#10;-- TEXT 亲和性：声明中包含 &quot;TEXT&quot;&#10;CREATE TABLE t2 (x TEXT);&#10;INSERT INTO t2 VALUES (456);&#10;SELECT x, typeof(x) FROM t2;&#10;-- 456 | text（整数 456 被转换为文本）&#10;&#10;-- BLOB 亲和性：无类型声明&#10;CREATE TABLE t3 (x);&#10;INSERT INTO t3 VALUES (789);&#10;SELECT x, typeof(x) FROM t3;&#10;-- 789 | integer（无亲和性，保持原始类型）\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- INTEGER 亲和性：声明中包含 \"INT\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> t1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (x </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INTEGER</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INSERT INTO</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> t1 </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VALUES</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'123'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> x, typeof(x) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> t1;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 123 | integer（文本 '123' 被转换为整数）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- TEXT 亲和性：声明中包含 \"TEXT\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> t2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (x </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INSERT INTO</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> t2 </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VALUES</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">456</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> x, typeof(x) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> t2;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 456 | text（整数 456 被转换为文本）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- BLOB 亲和性：无类型声明</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> t3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (x);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INSERT INTO</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> t3 </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VALUES</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">789</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> x, typeof(x) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> t3;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 789 | integer（无亲和性，保持原始类型）</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"类型比较规则\">类型比较规则</h2><p>SQLite 在比较不同存储类的值时遵循固定的排序规则：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"NULL &lt; INTEGER/REAL &lt; TEXT &lt; BLOB\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>NULL &#x3C; INTEGER/REAL &#x3C; TEXT &#x3C; BLOB</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 混合类型比较示例&#10;CREATE TABLE mixed (val);&#10;INSERT INTO mixed VALUES (NULL);&#10;INSERT INTO mixed VALUES (1);&#10;INSERT INTO mixed VALUES (2.5);&#10;INSERT INTO mixed VALUES (&#39;abc&#39;);&#10;INSERT INTO mixed VALUES (X&#39;FF&#39;);&#10;&#10;SELECT val, typeof(val) FROM mixed ORDER BY val;&#10;-- NULL     | null&#10;-- 1        | integer&#10;-- 2.5      | real&#10;-- abc      | text&#10;-- FF       | blob\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 混合类型比较示例</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> mixed</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (val);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INSERT INTO</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> mixed</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> VALUES</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INSERT INTO</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> mixed</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> VALUES</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INSERT INTO</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> mixed</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> VALUES</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INSERT INTO</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> mixed</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> VALUES</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'abc'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INSERT INTO</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> mixed</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> VALUES</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (X</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'FF'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> val, typeof(val) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> mixed</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> val;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- NULL     | null</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 1        | integer</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 2.5      | real</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- abc      | text</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- FF       | blob</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    NULL_V[NULL] --&gt;|小于| NUM_V[INTEGER / REAL]&#10;    NUM_V --&gt;|小于| TEXT_V[TEXT]&#10;    TEXT_V --&gt;|小于| BLOB_V[BLOB]\">graph LR\n    NULL_V[NULL] --&gt;|小于| NUM_V[INTEGER / REAL]\n    NUM_V --&gt;|小于| TEXT_V[TEXT]\n    TEXT_V --&gt;|小于| BLOB_V[BLOB]</pre><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> 在 WHERE 条件中比较不同类型时，SQLite 可能不会使用索引。确保比较双方类型一致，是避免性能问题的关键。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"strict-tables\">STRICT Tables</h2><p>SQLite 3.37.0（2021-11）引入了 <strong>STRICT 表</strong>，为需要强类型约束的场景提供支持。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 普通表：允许类型混搭&#10;CREATE TABLE loose (id INTEGER, name TEXT);&#10;INSERT INTO loose VALUES (&#39;not_a_number&#39;, 42);  -- 不报错&#10;&#10;-- STRICT 表：强制类型检查&#10;CREATE TABLE strict_users (&#10;    id   INTEGER PRIMARY KEY,&#10;    name TEXT,&#10;    age  INTEGER,&#10;    data BLOB&#10;) STRICT;&#10;&#10;-- 类型不匹配时抛出错误&#10;INSERT INTO strict_users VALUES (1, &#39;Alice&#39;, &#39;not_a_number&#39;, NULL);&#10;-- Error: cannot store TEXT value in INTEGER column strict_users.age\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 普通表：允许类型混搭</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> loose</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INTEGER</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">name</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INSERT INTO</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> loose </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VALUES</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'not_a_number'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">42</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);  </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 不报错</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- STRICT 表：强制类型检查</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> strict_users</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    id   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INTEGER</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    name</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    age  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INTEGER</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    data</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> BLOB</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) STRICT;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 类型不匹配时抛出错误</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INSERT INTO</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> strict_users </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VALUES</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Alice'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'not_a_number'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- Error: cannot store TEXT value in INTEGER column strict_users.age</span></span></code></pre></div><p>STRICT 表支持的数据类型：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>类型</th>\n<th>描述</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>INTEGER</td>\n<td>整数</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>REAL</td>\n<td>浮点数</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>TEXT</td>\n<td>文本字符串</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>BLOB</td>\n<td>二进制数据</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ANY</td>\n<td>接受任意类型（不转换）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 组合使用 STRICT 和 WITHOUT ROWID&#10;CREATE TABLE config (&#10;    key   TEXT PRIMARY KEY,&#10;    value ANY&#10;) STRICT, WITHOUT ROWID;&#10;&#10;INSERT INTO config VALUES (&#39;version&#39;, 1);&#10;INSERT INTO config VALUES (&#39;name&#39;, &#39;myapp&#39;);&#10;INSERT INTO config VALUES (&#39;debug&#39;, X&#39;01&#39;);&#10;&#10;SELECT key, value, typeof(value) FROM config;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 组合使用 STRICT 和 WITHOUT ROWID</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> config</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    key</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">   TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    value</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ANY</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) STRICT, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WITHOUT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ROWID;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INSERT INTO</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> config </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VALUES</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'version'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INSERT INTO</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> config </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VALUES</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'name'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'myapp'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INSERT INTO</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> config </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VALUES</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'debug'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, X</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'01'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> key</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">value</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, typeof(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">value</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> config;</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"常见陷阱与最佳实践\">常见陷阱与最佳实践</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>陷阱</th>\n<th>原因</th>\n<th>解决方案</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>日期存储不一致</td>\n<td>无原生日期类型</td>\n<td>统一用 ISO 8601 TEXT 存储</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>布尔值混乱</td>\n<td>无原生布尔类型</td>\n<td>约定 0/1 INTEGER 表示</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>大数精度丢失</td>\n<td>INTEGER 最大 8 字节</td>\n<td>超大数用 TEXT 存储</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>索引未命中</td>\n<td>类型亲和性导致隐式转换</td>\n<td>确保比较双方类型一致</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 日期存储最佳实践&#10;CREATE TABLE events (&#10;    id        INTEGER PRIMARY KEY,&#10;    name      TEXT NOT NULL,&#10;    event_at  TEXT NOT NULL DEFAULT (strftime(&#39;%Y-%m-%dT%H:%M:%SZ&#39;, &#39;now&#39;))&#10;) STRICT;&#10;&#10;INSERT INTO events (name) VALUES (&#39;部署上线&#39;);&#10;SELECT name, event_at FROM events;&#10;&#10;-- 布尔值约定&#10;CREATE TABLE flags (&#10;    feature TEXT PRIMARY KEY,&#10;    enabled INTEGER NOT NULL CHECK (enabled IN (0, 1))&#10;) STRICT, WITHOUT ROWID;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 日期存储最佳实践</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> events</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    id        </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INTEGER</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    name</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    event_at  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (strftime(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'%Y-%m-%dT%H:%M:%SZ'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'now'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) STRICT;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INSERT INTO</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> events (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VALUES</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'部署上线'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, event_at </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> events;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 布尔值约定</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> flags</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    feature </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    enabled</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> INTEGER</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> CHECK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">enabled</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> IN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) STRICT, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WITHOUT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ROWID;</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"mindmap\" data-source=\"mindmap&#10;  root((数据类型与亲和性))&#10;    存储类&#10;      NULL&#10;      INTEGER&#10;      REAL&#10;      TEXT&#10;      BLOB&#10;    类型亲和性&#10;      列级推荐类型&#10;      隐式转换规则&#10;      五种亲和性&#10;    比较规则&#10;      NULL 最小&#10;      数值 次之&#10;      TEXT 再次&#10;      BLOB 最大&#10;    STRICT 表&#10;      强制类型检查&#10;      ANY 类型&#10;      SQLite 3.37+&#10;    最佳实践&#10;      日期用 ISO 8601&#10;      布尔用 0/1&#10;      类型一致性\">mindmap\n  root((数据类型与亲和性))\n    存储类\n      NULL\n      INTEGER\n      REAL\n      TEXT\n      BLOB\n    类型亲和性\n      列级推荐类型\n      隐式转换规则\n      五种亲和性\n    比较规则\n      NULL 最小\n      数值 次之\n      TEXT 再次\n      BLOB 最大\n    STRICT 表\n      强制类型检查\n      ANY 类型\n      SQLite 3.37+\n    最佳实践\n      日期用 ISO 8601\n      布尔用 0/1\n      类型一致性</pre><ul>\n<li>SQLite 采用<strong>动态类型</strong>系统，类型绑定在值上而非列上。</li>\n<li>五种<strong>存储类</strong>是 SQLite 类型系统的基础：NULL、INTEGER、REAL、TEXT、BLOB。</li>\n<li><strong>类型亲和性</strong>为列提供&quot;推荐类型&quot;，插入时自动尝试类型转换。</li>\n<li>不同存储类之间有固定的排序规则，混合类型比较可能导致索引失效。</li>\n<li><strong>STRICT 表</strong>（3.37+）提供强制类型检查，适合对数据完整性要求高的场景。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"数据类型与亲和性","id":"数据类型与亲和性"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"动态类型系统","id":"动态类型系统"},{"level":2,"text":"类型亲和性","id":"类型亲和性"},{"level":2,"text":"类型比较规则","id":"类型比较规则"},{"level":2,"text":"STRICT Tables","id":"strict-tables"},{"level":2,"text":"常见陷阱与最佳实践","id":"常见陷阱与最佳实践"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"SQLite 架构","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/sqlite-embedded-db/foundations/sqlite-architecture"},"next":{"title":"Pragma 与配置","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/sqlite-embedded-db/foundations/pragmas-and-configuration"}}